    Returns:
        True if the file is marked as broken in parent documentation

    Example:
        >>> check_for_broken_marker_in_parent(Path(".codex/"), "MISSING_FILE.md")
        True  # if .codex/README.md contains <!-- BROKEN: MISSING_FILE.md -->
